# The pins of the local AI helper's runtime and model (ADR-0050, SDD-024 section 3).
# Sourced by scripts/install-aihelper-runtime.sh, which fetches them for development and CI. The product
# installs the same files through engine/aihost/manifest.json; a Go test (engine/aihost) fails when the two
# disagree, so change both together. The build of aihelper/ downloads nothing: `ort` loads the library from a
# path (rule 2 of .agents/rules/rust.md).
